# The public (training) slice is regenerated by `bjb build`, never committed:
# it is two orders of magnitude larger than the held-out slice, and the PRD's
# own non-goal is that the default distribution mechanism is a loader pointing
# at the original source rather than a re-hosted copy (§1.3). Its SHA-256 lives
# in bench/receipts/, so a rebuild that does not reproduce it is detected.
data/public/
exports/
